# Places and journeys
#
# A pond can hold a bowl, so custody can't assume a person. A site isn't the institution in it.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m09_place> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Places and journeys" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E53_Place

iy:City a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Place .
iy:Kingdom a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Place .
iy:Temple a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Place .
iy:Monastery a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Place .
iy:Pond a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Place .
iy:Site a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Place .
iy:Journey a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Movement .

iy:at a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:locatedIn a owl:ObjectProperty .
